# This directory holds the attendance backend SOURCE (Python/FastAPI).
# It sits inside the Apache Alias /phdtimeoff document root, so without this
# file the source — including .env with DB credentials — would be downloadable.
# The app itself is served by a reverse proxy to the Docker container, never
# from this directory. Keep this file in place. (Production nginx equivalent:
# `location /phdtimeoff/attendance { deny all; }` — see RUNBOOK.md.)
Require all denied
